 60ZN c  Beam of {+59}Cu with E=40 MeV/nucleon produced through fragmentation   
 60ZN2c  of a 240 MeV/nucleon primary beam of {+64}Zn ions. {+59}Cu beam        
 60ZN3c  was incident on a Cd{-2} target with thickness of 7.5 mg/cm{+2}.       
 60ZN4c  Measured E|g, I|g using the GRETINA array, and particle-|g             
 60ZN5c  coincidences using the S800 spectrograph. Comparison to ADWA           
 60ZN6c  calculations. Paper focuses only on proton-unbound states and          
 60ZN7c  indicates that the properties of bound states will be                  
 60ZN8c  presented elsewhere.                                                   
